### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FDS v2.0 통합 API 테스트 (FDS-DESIGN.md 기준)
### 실행 전제: MariaDB + Redis + Kafka + Spring Boot + Python AI 서버 기동 중
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@apiKey = fds-demo-api-key-change-me

### 1. 관리자 로그인 (Access / Refresh Token 자동 저장)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin1234!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 2. 현재 로그인 사용자 정보 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 3. 토큰 재발급 (Refresh Token Rotation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 4. 정상 결제 로그 수집 (KRW 45,000원, X-API-Key 필수)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logs
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "transactionId": "tc01-normal-{{$uuid}}",
  "userId": "user-1001",
  "amount": 45000,
  "merchantCategory": "grocery_pos",
  "transactionDate": "{{$isoTimestamp}}",
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.9780
}

### 5. 고액 이상 결제 로그 수집 (KRW 1,850,000원 → R3_HIGH_AMOUNT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logs
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "transactionId": "tc02-high-amount-{{$uuid}}",
  "userId": "user-1002",
  "amount": 1850000,
  "merchantCategory": "shopping_net",
  "transactionDate": "{{$isoTimestamp}}",
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.9780
}

### 6. 새벽 고위험 업종 결제 (KRW 450,000원, 02:30 KST → R4_NIGHT_HIGH_RISK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logs
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "transactionId": "tc03-night-risk-{{$uuid}}",
  "userId": "user-1003",
  "amount": 450000,
  "merchantCategory": "gambling",
  "transactionDate": "2026-11-22T02:30:00+09:00",
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.9780
}

### 7. 대시보드 KPI 요약 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 8. 최근 24시간 시간대별 트래픽 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/hourly-traffic
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 9. 카테고리별 사기 건수 집계 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/fraud-by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 10. 거래 내역 필터·검색·페이징 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?page=0&size=10&isFraud=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 11. 이상 탐지 알람 목록 조회 (미확인 필터)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?page=0&size=20&reviewStatus=UNCONFIRMED
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 12. 알람 사기 확정 처리 (ROLE_ADMIN 전용)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/alerts/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewStatus": "CONFIRMED_FRAUD",
  "reviewNote": "카드 소유주 확인 결과 도용 거래로 확정"
}

### 13. 로그아웃 (Refresh 삭제 + Access 블랙리스트)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
